OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney government unveils #4.2m
OL,4,Aspending plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlderney's government has proposed a
OL,7,F#4.2m capital spending programme for
OL,8,F2027 which avoids tax rises.
OL,10,FThe island's government forecasted a
OL,11,Fsurplus of #3,000 next year, and the
OL,12,FStates' finance committee said there
OL,13,Fwas "very little room for unexpected
OL,14,Fexpenditure or fluctuations in income"
OL,15,Fas part of the proposed budget.
OL,17,FThe proposals outline #2m earmarked for
OL,18,Fairport projects and #610,000 for road
OL,19,Fresurfacing.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
