OL,3,GNEWSAAlderney government unveils #4.2m
OL,4,Aspending plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also suggested marine fuel duty
OL,7,Fwould be cut to 0% in 2027 to support
OL,8,Fthe fishing industry and maritime
OL,9,Feconomy.
